source: crates/leptoskit_cli/tests/snapshots.rs
expression: "normalize(&stdout(&output), &scratch.path)"
---
Publishes an already signed code-push release to the provisioned bucket

Usage: leptoskit infra publish [OPTIONS] --platform <PLATFORM>

Options:
      --platform <PLATFORM>  Platform whose signed release to publish
      --store <STORE>        Local release store [default: releases]
      --channel <CHANNEL>    Release channel [default: production]
  -h, --help                 Print help
  -V, --version              Print version
